{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Get to the Chopper</strong> is a high-stakes first-person shooter where survival is everything. Fight your way through hostile environments, outgun enemy forces, and navigate rugged terrain to reach the extraction point. The helicopter is your only way out\u2014and it won\u2019t be there forever. Every second counts in this action-packed survival shooter.<br><br><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3572740/extras/get-to-the-chopper.gif?t=1745391452\" /><strong>Features:</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Diverse Combat Environments</strong><br>Engage in battles across dynamic maps including jungles, urban warzones, and mountain strongholds.<br><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3572740/extras/2.jpg?t=1745391452\" /></p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Full Arsenal Access</strong><br>Unlock and upgrade a wide range of weapons, from assault rifles and snipers to explosives and gear.<br><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3572740/extras/1.jpg?t=1745391452\" /></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Dynamic Enemy AI</strong><br>Face adaptive enemies that respond to your tactics, increasing the challenge with every mission.<br><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3572740/extras/3.jpg?t=1745391452\" /></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Player Progression System</strong><br>Earn cash to unlock new gear, and weapons as you complete missions.<br><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3572740/extras/unlock-weapon.png?t=1745391452\" /></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Seasonal Battle Pass</strong><br>Complete challenges and climb tiers to unlock exclusive cosmetic rewards and bonuses each season.<br><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3572740/extras/battle-pass.jpg?t=1745391452\" /></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Achievements &amp; Challenges</strong><br>Track your progress and prove your skills by completing in-game milestones and unlocking achievements.<br><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3572740/extras/achievement.png?t=1745391452\" /></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Multilingual Support</strong> <br>Play in your preferred language. Supported languages: <strong>English, Korean, Russian, Japanese, Traditional Chinese,</strong> and <strong>Simplified Chinese</strong>.<br><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3572740/extras/language.png?t=1745391452\" /></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">You have one job. Get To The Chopper before it takes off. Kill everyone in the process.</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3572740?t=1745391452","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3572740?t=1745391452","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3572740/d9dfb218d935b6b49351d2ea5f641c57a5a80cfb/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1745391452","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3572740/d9dfb218d935b6b49351d2ea5f641c57a5a80cfb/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1745391452","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"demos":[{"appid":3659710,"description":""}],"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Get to the Chopper</strong> is a high-stakes first-person shooter where survival is everything. 